{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"单射"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"单射"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>生象</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 中的单射就是 $(-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"映射. 映射 $f\\colon Y\\to X$ 是单射, 当且仅当它是 $X$ 的若干连通分支的含入.</p>\n<h3>一般范畴</h3>\n<p>定义一般范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 是单射当且仅当对任意对象 $X\\in\\mathcal C$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Z,X) \\to \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Z,Y)\r\n$$\n是单射.</p>\n<p>参见 "},{"Local":{"url":"AyalaFrancisRozenblyumI","text":"Ayala–Francis–Rozenblyum"}},{"Plain":" 5.1 节.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>范畴的范畴</h3>\n<p>范畴的范畴 "},{"Local":{"url":"Cat","text":"$\\mathsf{Cat}$"}},{"Plain":" 中的单射是满足如下条件的函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$F$ 给出"},{"Local":{"url":"对象的生象","text":"对象的生象"}},{"Plain":"的单射 $\\mathcal C^{\\simeq} \\to \\mathcal D^{\\simeq}$;</li>\n<li>对任意两个对象 $X,Y\\in\\mathcal C$, 映射 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X),F(Y))$ 为单射.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注意, 上述条件比"},{"Local":{"url":"全忠实函子","text":"全忠实函子"}},{"Plain":"弱.</p>\n"}]}}